  "body": "#11527 has minutes for the last meeting. The next one is scheduled for August 14, 4pm UTC. This is next week in the Americas and Europe friendly time.\n\nPeople interested in attending the next call please respond here or reach out privately to @cwilso or the editors. We will be tagging issues for the next call again using [agenda+](https://github.com/whatwg/html/labels/agenda%2B) in all WHATWG repositories across [issues](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Awhatwg+is%3Aopen+label%3Aagenda%2B&type=issues) and [pull requests](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Awhatwg+is%3Aopen+label%3Aagenda%2B&type=pullrequests) and we would like to invite anyone that can contribute to join us.",
